'''Raichu''' (Japanese: '''ライチュウ''' ''Raichu'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

